    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lynam Auctioneers are delighted to introduce this stunning ground floor, light filled apartment to the market. No 2 The Wellington is presented in excellent condition throughout and boasts beautiful south facing views, direct access to a private river walk for residents only, an underground car parking space and additional storage in the basement.\r\n\r\nUpon entry, accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with recessed lighting and timber flooring. The hallway opens to a bright living and kitchen area. The kitchen itself has sleek cabinetary, modern appliances and a separate island.  The living room is flooded with natural light from the south facing aspect and double doors opening to the private river walk. No. 2 has 2 double bedrooms and a refurbished bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe Riverpark development is extremely well situated off Conyngham Road, Islandbridge. No. 2 also offer picturesque views of the river and the apartment is located close to the Phoenix Park. There are a host of local amenities on your doorstep as well as excellent transport links including the Red Luas Line and Hueston Station within walking distance. \r\n\r\nNo. 2 The Wellington offers the discerning purchaser the opportunity to own a spacious property located in a highly sought after location.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: c. 2.63m x 4.53m\r\n\r\nBathroom: c. 1.66m x 1.94m\r\n\r\nHot press: c. 0.79m x 0.99m\r\n\r\nLiving/dining room: c. 6.61m x 3.97m\r\n\r\nKitchen: c. 1.55m x 3.26m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c. 4.04m x 2.65m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 4.04m x 2.68m\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of the floor plan contained here, measurements of doors, windows, rooms and any other item are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission, or misstatement. This plan is for illustrative purposes only and should only be used as such by any prospective purchaser."
      },
      {
